(7740321, 1276340, 66597, '<td valign="top">This was one of my top challenge picks; I think the juxtaposition of the little dragon with the vent is so cute - like he popped out to say hi.</td>', 'This was one of my top challenge picks; I think the juxtaposition of the little dragon with the vent is so cute - like he popped out to say hi.', '2023-03-17 07:27:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740322, 1276576, 122678, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Wow.. what an image! I am blown away with the lighting and the crisp focus, perfection. I am always trying to learn but I just can''t figure this image out. Would you be so kind as to give some comments?<br/>Many congratulations on your creativity and photographic skills.</td>', 'Congratulations, Wow.. what an image! I am blown away with the lighting and the crisp focus, perfection. I am always trying to learn but I just can''t figure this image out. Would you be so kind as to give some comments?Many congratulations on your creativity and photographic skills.', '2023-03-17 08:11:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740323, 1276573, 122678, '<td valign="top">OMGoodness.. WOW!   WOW!   WOW! I love this image. Perfect for this challenge and so well executed. A fine piece of art and a very well deserved ribbon. Many congratulations on this image, you nailed it.</td>', 'OMGoodness.. WOW!   WOW!   WOW! I love this image. Perfect for this challenge and so well executed. A fine piece of art and a very well deserved ribbon. Many congratulations on this image, you nailed it.', '2023-03-17 08:15:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740324, 1276460, 122678, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, a super image. I love the out lines so each tool could be put back in place. Very cool and retro.</td>', 'Congratulations, a super image. I love the out lines so each tool could be put back in place. Very cool and retro.', '2023-03-17 08:17:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740325, 1276347, 122678, '<td valign="top">Congrats, an amazing find and well presented.</td>', 'Congrats, an amazing find and well presented.', '2023-03-17 08:18:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740327, 1276585, 122678, '<td valign="top">Congratulations top 5.<br/>Beautiful coloration against the metal, nicely presented.</td>', 'Congratulations top 5.Beautiful coloration against the metal, nicely presented.', '2023-03-17 08:22:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740328, 1276575, 122678, '<td valign="top">A really good image for this challenge. I like that it really exemplifies the heavy beating metal takes over time, its durability and breakdown. You caught that here.</td>', 'A really good image for this challenge. I like that it really exemplifies the heavy beating metal takes over time, its durability and breakdown. You caught that here.', '2023-03-17 08:25:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740329, 1276568, 122678, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice image. I am always drawn to crisp and that it is. Such a magnificent idea for this challenge. A stand out image for me.<br/></td>', 'This is a really nice image. I am always drawn to crisp and that it is. Such a magnificent idea for this challenge. A stand out image for me.', '2023-03-17 08:28:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740330, 1276418, 122678, '<td valign="top">Congrats top 10. I like the presentation of metal in this image. Your image says so much with the stages metal goes through over the years.</td>', 'Congrats top 10. I like the presentation of metal in this image. Your image says so much with the stages metal goes through over the years.', '2023-03-17 08:30:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740336, 1276576, 2333, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue Dave! I thought this one might go that way. Flipping fantastic score, nothing below a 5!</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue Dave! I thought this one might go that way. Flipping fantastic score, nothing below a 5!', '2023-03-17 09:50:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740345, 1276576, 60805, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you guys like it, thanks for the votes and comments. And none below 5 for real <img border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/1.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/1.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/1.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=2333" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Kirbic</a> :) <img border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=122678" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Barroness</a> <img border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat</a> I stacked the screws on a tablet and the background image was on a laptop monitor background. Lighting one godox ad200 cam left, pointed up, diffused with lettersize paper a little above. Bounced to wall and ceiling to simulate direction of the moonlight. Angle was kinda off but was in a hurry. I also basically shut down the ambient prior.</td>', 'I''m glad you guys like it, thanks for the votes and comments. And none below 5 for real  Kirbic :)  Barroness  Neat I stacked the screws on a tablet and the background image was on a laptop monitor background. Lighting one godox ad200 cam left, pointed up, diffused with lettersize paper a little above. Bounced to wall and ceiling to simulate direction of the moonlight. Angle was kinda off but was in a hurry. I also basically shut down the ambient prior.', '2023-03-17 13:38:23.000000', NULL, 0),
